---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Get to know me better - my story, experience, and what drives my passion for development"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<section class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">👋 Hello there!</h2>
			<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
				Welcome to my corner of the web! I'm a passionate developer who loves creating beautiful,
				functional applications that make a difference. This space is where I share my thoughts,
				experiences, and the lessons I've learned along my coding journey.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">🚀 My Journey</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				My path into development started with curiosity and grew into a full-blown passion.
				I love solving complex problems, learning new technologies, and building things that
				people actually want to use. Whether it's a sleek frontend interface or a robust
				backend system, I'm always excited to dive into the next challenge.
			</p>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
				When I'm not coding, you'll find me exploring new frameworks, contributing to open
				source projects, or sharing knowledge with the developer community. I believe in
				continuous learning and the power of collaboration to create amazing things.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">💡 What I Do</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
				<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3">Frontend Development</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600">
						Creating responsive, accessible, and performant user interfaces using modern
						frameworks and best practices.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3">Backend Systems</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600">
						Building scalable APIs, databases, and server architectures that power
						great user experiences.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">📫 Let's Connect</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				I love connecting with fellow developers, designers, and anyone passionate about
				technology. Whether you want to collaborate on a project, discuss the latest in
				web development, or just say hello, I'd love to hear from you!
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				<a href="mailto:hello@example.com" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
					✉️ Email Me
				</a>
				<a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-gray-800 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-900 transition-colors">
					🐙 GitHub
				</a>
				<a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-blue-400 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors">
					🐦 Twitter
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
